[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":1661},["ShallowReactive",2],{"page-\u002Fgo\u002F09-structs":3},{"id":4,"title":5,"body":6,"description":1654,"extension":1655,"meta":1656,"navigation":80,"path":1657,"seo":1658,"stem":1659,"__hash__":1660},"content\u002Fgo\u002F09-structs.md","09 — Structs",{"type":7,"value":8,"toc":1642},"minimark",[9,13,22,27,390,393,397,404,663,668,675,708,712,722,788,819,823,1013,1016,1020,1122,1126,1276,1280,1283,1417,1420,1632,1635,1638],[10,11,5],"h1",{"id":12},"_09-structs",[14,15,16,17,21],"p",{},"Structs are Go's way of grouping data — the closest thing to a class, but without inheritance. Go favors ",[18,19,20],"strong",{},"composition over inheritance",".",[23,24,26],"h2",{"id":25},"declaration-and-use","Declaration and Use",[28,29,31],"code-wrapper",{"language":30},"go",[32,33,37],"pre",{"className":34,"code":35,"language":30,"meta":36,"style":36},"language-go shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","type Point struct {\n    X, Y int\n}\n\np := Point{1, 2}           \u002F\u002F positional (fragile — order matters)\np := Point{X: 1, Y: 2}     \u002F\u002F named (clear, order-independent)\np := Point{}               \u002F\u002F zero value: {0 0}\np.X = 5                    \u002F\u002F field access\n\n\u002F\u002F Nested struct (anonymous field type)\ntype Circle struct {\n    Point          \u002F\u002F embedded — promotes Point's fields\n    Radius int\n}\n\nc := Circle{Point: Point{1, 2}, Radius: 5}\nc.X            \u002F\u002F 1 (promoted from embedded Point)\nc.Point.X      \u002F\u002F 1 (explicit)\n``\n::\n\n## Struct Literals\n\n::code-wrapper{language=\"go\"}\n```go\n\u002F\u002F Named fields (preferred — order-independent, clear)\np := Point{X: 1, Y: 2}\n\n\u002F\u002F Positional (fragile — adding a field breaks all literals)\np := Point{1, 2}\n\n\u002F\u002F Partial (omitted fields are zero)\np := Point{X: 1}   \u002F\u002F Y = 0\n\n\u002F\u002F Empty (all zero)\np := Point{}\n``\n","",[38,39,40,60,69,75,82,113,138,153,168,173